     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All,<div><br></div><div>We will have our regular work session tomorrow from 1-3pm in Wickson 2124.  I&#39;ll be working on finalizing the custom image-sizing package for our <a href=\"http://d-rug.github.io/blog/2016/Announcing-the-Inaugural-Dissertation-aRt-Event!\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://d-rug.github.io/blog/2016/Announcing-the-Inaugural-Dissertation-aRt-Event!&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467131181000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2H3qSl1wZGB2vzFDiyM6F0\">Dissertation aRt social</a> on Friday, so if you have any questions related to writing R packages, version control, or want to <a href=\"https://github.com/Myfanwy/sizer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Myfanwy/sizer&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467131181000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2A934UOvnHM0ijPCqROEVo\">contribute to the package</a>, that will be my focus tomorrow.</div><div><br></div><div>But as always, bring whatever R questions/problems you&#39;re working on, and we&#39;ll see you there!</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Myfanwy</div></div><div dir=\"ltr\">-- <br></div><div data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div>Myfanwy Johnston<div>Ph.D Candidate, UC Davis</div><div>Animal Behavior Graduate Group</div><div>Biotelemetry Laboratory</div><div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">__________________________</font></div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">I welcome VSRE emails.  </font></div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">Learn more at<span> </span><a href=\"http://vsre.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;